Recommends: android-sdk-platform-tools
Description: CLI tool to expose Android devices remotely via NativeBridge
 BridgeLink is a production-ready CLI tool that exposes your local Android
 devices remotely via the NativeBridge platform, making them accessible
 from anywhere with secure tunneling powered by bore.
 .
 Features:
  - One-Command Setup
  - Multi-Device Support
  - Secure Tunneling with API key authentication
  - Remote Access from anywhere
  - Auto-Installation of bore tunnel and ADB
  - Cross-Platform support (macOS, Linux, Windows)
  - Background tunnel management
  - Automatic Health Monitoring
  - Auto-Activation on device reconnection
